#: ../../examples/index.rst:4
msgid "Small, complete programs you can run, read, and copy. Each one uses the real runtime with a deterministic adapter, so it produces the same output without credentials — and teaches framework behavior rather than model quality."
msgstr "小巧、完整、可运行、可阅读、可复制的程序。每个示例都使用真实的运行时和确定性的适配器，因此无需凭据也能产生相同的输出，并且展示的是框架行为，而不是模型质量。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:8
msgid "Start with :doc:`../learn/first-agent`, then build your own extension in :doc:`../extending/first-extension`. For a real provider, follow :doc:`../learn/providers`."
msgstr "先从\\ :doc:`../learn/first-agent`\\ 开始，然后在\\ :doc:`../extending/first-extension`\\ 中构建你自己的扩展。要接入真实的模型提供商，请参阅\\ :doc:`../learn/providers`\\ 。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:19
msgid "Watch a tool call, its result, and the final answer in one stream."
msgstr "在同一条流中观察工具调用、工具结果和最终回答。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:25
msgid "Restore a conversation from SQLite in a new process."
msgstr "在新进程中从 SQLite 恢复对话。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:27
msgid "On-demand skills"
msgstr "按需技能"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:31
msgid "Read one skill's instructions through a real tool round trip."
msgstr "通过一次真实的工具往返读取某个技能的指令。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:37
msgid "Replace older turns with a checkpoint when context grows."
msgstr "当上下文增长时，用检查点替换较早的轮次。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:43
msgid "Pause a privileged tool until the UI answers."
msgstr "暂停高权限工具，直到 UI 作出响应。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:49
msgid "Record model usage, cache counts, and message timing for diagnostics."
msgstr "记录模型用量、缓存计数和消息耗时，用于诊断。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:51
msgid "Subagent"
msgstr "子智能体"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:55
msgid "Delegate one task to a child profile with its own tools."
msgstr "把一项任务委派给拥有独立工具的子智能体。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:61
msgid "Start children without waiting, then read their reports."
msgstr "无需等待即可启动子智能体，之后再读取它们的报告。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:67
msgid "Stop mid-stream and keep the runtime reusable."
msgstr "在流式输出中途停止，并让运行时保持可复用。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:69
msgid "Goal mode"
msgstr "目标模式"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:73
msgid "Keep working until an evaluator agrees the goal is met."
msgstr "持续工作，直到评估者认可目标已达成。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:79
msgid "Back sessions with your own storage implementation."
msgstr "用你自己的存储实现为会话提供后端。"

#: ../../examples/index.rst:81
msgid "Run every offline example with ``make docs-examples``. Tests disable network connections and use a temporary working directory for each program."
msgstr "用 ``make docs-examples`` 运行所有离线示例。测试会禁用网络连接，并为每个程序使用临时工作目录。"

